      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "For wind damage roof repair near Heber City and surrounding areas in Utah, local contractors like Frame Restoration Utah LLC . (located at 142 S Main St, Heber City, UT, phone: +1 435-292-8802) provide inspections, written scopes, and storm restoration services.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "Frame Restoration Utah LLC"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "What Wind Damage Does to Utah Roofs"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Lifted or Missing Shingles: High gusts and downslope canyon winds lift shingles or break the adhesive seal underneath, even if the shingle lays back down.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              1,
              2
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Damaged Flashing & Ridge Caps: Wind pulls at metal flashing around chimneys, vents, and roof edges, or loosens ridge caps.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              1,
              3
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Hidden Water Leaks: Unsealed or torn areas let in rain, melting snow, and wind-driven moisture, which can lead to interior ceiling stains or rotted decking.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              1,
              3,
              4
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Debris Impact: Flying tree branches can puncture or dent the roof surface.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              2,
              5
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Repair vs. Full Replacement"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Localized Repair: Best when the roof is relatively new, has plenty of service life left, and damage is restricted to a small, isolated section.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              3
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Full Replacement: Recommended if wind damage is spread across multiple slopes, shingles are brittle or granulating throughout, or the roof is nearing the end of its lifespan.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              3
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "See more details on evaluating storm damage in the Utah Storm Damage Roof Guide and learn what to expect via a Wind Damage Roof Repair Example .",
            "snippet_links": [
              {
                "text": "Utah Storm Damage Roof Guide",
                "link": "https://usasuperior.com/storm-damage-roof/"
              },
              {
                "text": "Wind Damage Roof Repair Example",
                "link": "https://bigwestroofing.com/wind-damage-roof-repair-example-utah-homes/"
              }
            ],
            "reference_indexes": [
              3,
              6
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
